@Presentation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5075

### Get activities for November (months are 1-12; years are 1-9999)
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?year=2026&month=11
Accept: application/json

### Leap-year February
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?year=2028&month=2
Accept: application/json

### December and January are separate calendar months
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?year=2026&month=12
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?year=2027&month=1
Accept: application/json

### Maximum supported year and month
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?year=9999&month=12
Accept: application/json

### Invalid month: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?year=2026&month=0
Accept: application/json

### Missing year: 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/activities/GetActivitiesByMonth?month=11
Accept: application/json
